Huh?

251
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,300
What was that?

252
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,380
I'm surrounded!

253
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:39,320
Just stay calm and back up slowly.

254
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:54,420
Help me! Someone!

255
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:04,200
Hey, Seto, what's that?

256
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:07,120
It looks like a way out!

257
00:17:07,580 --> 00:17:08,420
Come on, Seto!

258
00:17:09,940 --> 00:17:11,980
Mokuba, slow down!

259
00:17:14,100 --> 00:17:16,440
It's probably an emergency exit.

260
00:17:16,800 --> 00:17:18,057
Back to the real world.

261
00:17:18,140 --> 00:17:19,620
Mokuba, stop right there.

262
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:23,760
We have to be careful.

263
00:17:28,020 --> 00:17:29,400
I can't see.

264
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:30,960
It's too bright.

265
00:17:31,840 --> 00:17:32,860
Wait a sec.

266
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:34,540
I know this place.

267
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,900
It's the orphanage we grew up in.

268
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:38,537
Who knew it was still around?

269
00:17:38,620 --> 00:17:40,180
It's a trick, Moguba.

270
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:43,146
A cheap virtual illusion
like everything else.

271
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:46,200
But how did Noah find
out we once lived here?

272
00:17:47,260 --> 00:17:50,760
We may as well close the
book on this duel, Yugi.

273
00:17:51,140 --> 00:17:52,905
Thanks to my wise investments,

274
00:17:53,140 --> 00:17:55,840
I predict a major growth in power for me,

275
00:17:56,060 --> 00:18:00,800
while you sink deeper into debt thanks
to your pathetic deckmaster, Karibo.

276
00:18:04,520 --> 00:18:07,557
Well, it appears your
little furball has an idea.

277
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,620
Too bad he can't speak.

278
00:18:10,820 --> 00:18:11,760
Stay calm.

279
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:14,577
I wish I knew what Kariba
was trying to tell me.

280
00:18:14,660 --> 00:18:18,197
He may know something about these new
Deckmaster dueling rules that I don't.

281
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:21,157
And right now I could use
all the advice I could get.

282
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:23,280
Give up yet? No.

283
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,240
Just what I needed.

284
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:29,640
Now, I play Polymerization!

285
00:18:30,820 --> 00:18:35,760
Fusing together Berphomet and
Gazelle, the king of mythical beasts!

286
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:41,960
To form Chimera, the
flying mythical beast!

287
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:44,906
Then I'll activate my
Magic Card Quick Attack!

288
00:18:45,260 --> 00:18:49,140
Allowing my Chimera to
attack your Iperia now!

289
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:54,460
An interesting move, Yuki.

290
00:18:54,960 --> 00:18:57,380
But a very poor business decision.

291
00:18:57,680 --> 00:19:01,240
And now, it's time for
you to pay the price!

292
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:03,180
Explain yourself, Gansley.

293
00:19:03,540 --> 00:19:06,237
Remember, I've taken the
form of Deep Sea Warrior.

294
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:09,360
And thanks to my Deckmaster ability,

295
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:14,000
I can sacrifice my two
monsters to create this!

296
00:19:14,860 --> 00:19:18,300
Reflector Pole, bounce
his attack right back!

297
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:19,830
What?

298
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:24,550
No!

299
00:19:33,260 --> 00:19:36,237
Looks like your life points
are starting to collapse!

300
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:40,379
And before long, you'll be completely
drained of everything you have.

301
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:43,780
You haven't put me out
of business yet, Gensley.

302
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:47,060
It's only a matter of time, Yugi. Soon,

303
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:49,557
my colleagues and I will
destroy you and your

304
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:53,220
friends in the greatest
corporate takeover in history.

305
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:58,662
Speaking of your friends, I wonder how
they're holding up in their new environment.

306
00:19:58,780 --> 00:19:59,662
Think about it.

307
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:03,391
Those fools must be suffering
even greater losses than you.

308
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,377
And you can't save them.

309
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:06,420
He's right!

310
00:20:06,660 --> 00:20:08,778
We've got to end this and find them!

311
00:20:08,880 --> 00:20:11,417
One more attack to your
small reserve of life points

312
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:14,077
and your resources will
be completely wiped out,

313
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:16,101
leaving you trapped here forever!
